---
import { processSteps } from '../data/content';
---

<section class="relative border-t border-line py-20 md:py-28">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-16">
      <div class="reveal lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cara kerja</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl leading-tight font-bold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-4xl">
          Transparan dari diskusi pertama sampai serah terima.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
          Anda selalu tahu ada di tahap mana, apa yang sedang dikerjakan, dan apa yang akan datang.
          Tidak ada fase gelap selama dua bulan.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-line bg-parchment-50/50 px-4 py-3">
          <span class="size-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500"></span>
          <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-navy-700">
            Demo progres setiap minggu di environment staging yang bisa Anda akses sendiri.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ol class="relative space-y-1">
        {
          processSteps.map((step) => (
            <li class="group relative flex gap-5 rounded-xl px-2 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-parchment-50/40">
              <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
                <span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line bg-parchment-50 font-mono text-[11px] text-navy-700 transition-colors group-hover:border-gold-500 group-hover:text-gold-600">
                  {step.number}
                </span>
                <span class="mt-1 w-px flex-1 bg-line group-last:hidden"></span>
              </div>

              <div class="pb-2">
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                  <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-navy-950">{step.title}</h3>
                  <span class="chip">{step.output}</span>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-navy-700">{step.description}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
